    "observed": "Nov 2025 Avenue N (549-sideA_062, 17 m): weathered grey concrete process building about four storeys with an open galvanized switchback stair at the SSE end of the ENE face, white stair head-house and pipe guard rails on the roof, blue steel doors and panels, two recessed galleries with rails, a high louvre, a tall white stack at the NNW corner. Nov 2025 10th St (behind trees): white blower casings, ducts and tanks along the NNW side in front of a concrete wall with louvres.",
